    "chunk_text": "\u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s feower hunde wintrum & feower & siextegum, \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00dea gesawon hie Romane scipa on \u00f0\u00e6m s\u00e6 irnan. \u00dea hr\u00e6dlice comon Tarentine to heora agnum scipum, & \u00fea o\u00fere hindan offoran, & hie ealle him & \u00fea \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r gefongne w\u00e6ron hie tawedan mid \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6stan unie\u00f0nesse: sume ofslogon, sume \u00d0a Romane \u00fe\u00e6t geacsedan, \u00fea sendon hie \u00e6rendracan to him, & b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t him man gebette \u00fe\u00e6t \u00d0a tawedan hie eft \u00fea \u00e6rendracan mid \u00fe\u00e6m m\u00e6stan bismere, swa hie \u00fea o\u00fere \u00e6r dydon, & hie \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m foran Romane on Tarentine. & swa cl\u00e6ne hie namon heora fultum mid him, \u00fe\u00e6tte heora proletarii ne moston him be\u00e6ftan Hie \u00fea Romane comon on Tarentine, & \u00fe\u00e6r eall aweston \u00fe\u00e6t hie metton, & monega byrg abr\u00e6con. \u00dea sendon Tarentine \u00e6gwern \u00e6fter fultume, \u00fe\u00e6r hie him \u00e6niges wendon. & Pirrus, Epira cyning, him com to mid \u00fe\u00e6m m\u00e6stan fultume, \u00e6g\u00feer ge an gangehere, ge on He w\u00e6s on \u00f0\u00e6m dagum gem\u00e6rsad ofer ealle o\u00feere cyningas, \u00e6g\u00feer ge mid his miclan fultume, ge For \u00feon fylste Pirrus Tarentinum for \u00feon \u00fee Tarente seo burg w\u00e6s getimbred of L\u00e6cedemonium, \u00fee & he h\u00e6fde Thesalium him to fultume & M\u00e6cedonie. & he h\u00e6fde XX elpenda to \u00fe\u00e6m g",
